    <string name="setup_adb_steps">This TV\'s own home screen keeps the Home button until it\'s turned off, which only adb can do:\n1. In Settings, open About and select the build number 7 times to turn on Developer options.\n2. In Developer options, turn on USB debugging (or Wireless debugging).\n3. From a computer, or an adb app on your phone, connect to the TV and run:</string>
    <string name="setup_adb_command" translatable="false">adb shell pm disable-user --user 0 %s</string>
    <string name="setup_adb_undo">To go back, run the same commands with pm enable.</string>
